<!-- Three pages is the whole site. About and Products are anchors on the
     landing page, not URLs, so they do not belong here.
     /design-system/ is excluded on purpose: it is internal, and _redirects
     301s it to /. A sitemap advertising a redirect is worse than no entry.

     The two legal URLs are extensionless. Cloudflare Pages 308s /foo.html to
     /foo, so the .html form these carried at first was a redirect, which is
     the same fault one line up. The pages still LINK to each other as .html;
     only the canonical, og:url and these entries name the settled URL. -->
